#: ../../../examples/extensions/package_signing/package_signing_with_openssl.rst:243
msgid ""
"As you see, Conan is performing an internal checksum verification for the "
"files and calling the ``verify()`` function of the plugin that uses the "
"``openssl`` executable to verify the recipe and the package with a command "
"similar to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../examples/extensions/package_signing/package_signing_with_openssl.rst:246
msgid ""
"$ openssl dgst -sha256 -verify public_key.pem -signature pkgsign-manifest."
"json.sig pkgsign-manifest.json"
msgstr ""

